{"version":1,"key":"card:760","content":{"id":760,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在打开浏览器网络面板的时候，会发现浏览器发送的请求始终携带三个请求头，比如下面是一个向服务端请求数据时携带的请求头"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"Sec-Fetch-Site: same-origin\nSec-Fetch-Mode: cors\nSec-Fetch-Dest: empty","language":"HTTP","uuid":"c71859de-2a61-4c1e-8ad6-af81052c0d73","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这三个请求头被称为 Fetch Metadata Request Header，它们的目的是给服务器提供请求的上下文，比如这个请求是通过 JavaScript 发起的，还是页面导航跳转的，请求的资源类型是什么，是否跨站，是否由用户主动发起。服务器知道了这些信息，就可以用来有效防御跨站攻击。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"实际上 Fetch Metadata 规范一共定义了四个请求头，除了上面出现的三个，还有一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Sec-Fetch-User","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它只在特定场景下才会出现。下面逐一来看："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Sec-Fetch-Site","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：表示请求来源的 origin 与目标资源的 origin 之间的关系，有四种取值"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"same-origin","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：完全相同的 origin，即协议、域名和端口都相同"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"same-site","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：协议和可注册域名相同（eTLD+1 相同）"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"https://www.example.com\nhttps://api.example.com\nhttps://static.example.com","language":"HTTP","uuid":"b7390305-e448-47d8-9104-59c02e5c1c3a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这三个地址就是 same-site 的，因为它们协议相同，都是 https，它们的 eTLD+1 都是 example.com，所以是 same-site，但是子域名不同，所以不是 same-origin"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"cross-site","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：不是同一个站点，比如 https://a.com 与 https://b.com"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"none","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：请求不是从页面中发起的，比如用户在地址栏直接输入地址、从书签打开网页、或者拖拽链接打开页面"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Sec-Fetch-Mode","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：表示请求的模式，即请求是以什么方式发出的，有五种取值"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"navigate","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：页面导航，包括地址栏输入、点击链接、iframe 导航、表单提交跳转"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"cors","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：通过 fetch/XHR 发起的网络请求，虽然模式叫 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"cors","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但不代表一定是跨域请求，是否跨域要看 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Sec-Fetch-Site","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"no-cors","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"："},{"type":"formatted","text":"<img>","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"<script>","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"<link rel=\"stylesheet\">","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等传统标签加载资源时使用该模式"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"same-origin","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"："},{"type":"formatted","text":"new Worker()","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 加载脚本时，或通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"fetch","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 显式指定 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"mode: 'same-origin'","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"websocket","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"new WebSocket()","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 建立连接时"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Sec-Fetch-Dest","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：表示请求的目标用途，即请求到的资源会被浏览器怎么使用。它有 24 种取值，具体可以参考 "},{"type":"link","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Headers/Sec-Fetch-Dest","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Sec-Fetch-Dest header"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，挑几个常见的来说"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"document","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：顶级页面导航，如地址栏输入地址、点击链接打开页面"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"script","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"："},{"type":"formatted","text":"<script>","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签请求资源、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"importScripts()","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 请求"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"style","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"："},{"type":"formatted","text":"<link rel=\"stylesheet\">","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 请求样式表"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"image","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"："},{"type":"formatted","text":"<img>","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、CSS 背景图片、favicon、SVG "},{"type":"formatted","text":"<image>","code":true}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"font","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：CSS "},{"type":"formatted","text":"@font-face","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 加载字体"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"iframe","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"："},{"type":"formatted","text":"<iframe>","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 加载页面"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"empty","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：没有特定资源类型，常见于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"fetch()","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"XHR","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"sendBeacon()","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"EventSource","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"WebSocket","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"它不是表示空请求，而是说响应不会被浏览器作为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"document","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"image","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"script","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"style","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等特定资源类型来消费"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Sec-Fetch-User","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：只在导航请求（"},{"type":"formatted","text":"Sec-Fetch-Mode","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"navigate","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"）且由用户主动触发时才会携带，值始终为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"?1","code":true},{"text":"，没有用户激活时该请求头会被省略。用户真实点击链接或提交表单通常会携带；自动 Meta Refresh、定时器或页面脚本自动发起的导航通常不会携带。","type":"formatted"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这些以 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Sec-","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 开头的请求头都是 Forbidden Request Header，JavaScript 无法通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"setRequestHeader","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"fetch","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"headers ","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"选项来修改它们，这保证了服务端收到的信息是可信的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"了解了每个字段的含义后，来看一些实际场景中它们是如何组合的。当用户点击链接访问一个同站页面时，浏览器会发送："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"HTTP","code":"Sec-Fetch-Site: same-origin\nSec-Fetch-Mode: navigate\nSec-Fetch-Dest: document\nSec-Fetch-User: ?1","uuid":"d404b420-7c12-407e-9e24-e2cfb55ffa97","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当页面通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"<script>","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签加载同站脚本时："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"HTTP","code":"Sec-Fetch-Site: same-origin\nSec-Fetch-Mode: no-cors\nSec-Fetch-Dest: script","uuid":"c79d2ec1-a5c8-4335-98d4-c7fdf140c75a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当页面通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"<img>","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签加载同站图片时："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"HTTP","code":"Sec-Fetch-Site: same-origin\nSec-Fetch-Mode: no-cors\nSec-Fetch-Dest: image","uuid":"d22f5be6-42c2-419d-afed-0a5c64cbfd72","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当页面通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"fetch()","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 向同站接口请求数据时："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"HTTP","code":"Sec-Fe